    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Multipass handbag first appeared on the runway for Louis Vuitton's Resort 2026 show, drawing inspiration from the classic Express bag. Rendered in signature Monogram canvas or supple calfskin, its hobo silhouette features a naturally draped opening that exudes an air of effortless nonchalance. A detachable top handle and shoulder strap allow for hand, shoulder, or crossbody carry, while the leather-wrapped chain adds a refined finishing touch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
