          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/pax7od3/dbca2c326369eeef.jpg",
          "price": "Multipass"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/pax7od3/3240ce7d9fd08c89.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/pax7od3/72d96ae174dedb61.jpg",
          "price": "Express"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For Fall/Winter 2026, the Multipass Mini reinterprets the classic Multipass silhouette in a compact form. Measuring 17.5 x 18 x 9.5 cm, its petite dimensions are accentuated by contrasting VVN leather side trim, making the metal chain detail all the more striking.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
