    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag is crafted from Louis Vuitton's most recognizable coated Monogram canvas. Originally developed to cover wooden travel trunks, this material is prized for its lightweight durability and water resistance. The entire bag weighs just 235 grams, making it an effortless companion.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
