    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Despite its mini size, the Multipass bag offers surprisingly generous storage. It closes with a top zipper, and the tobacco-colored fabric lining is both lightweight and scratch-resistant. The back features the classic VVN leather tag.",
