      "text": "We managed to fit an iPhone, a Zippy coin purse, a small wallet, keys, earphones, lipstick, and perfume. Everyday essentials slip in with ease, and even a small umbrella or a bottle of water can be accommodated. Compact yet capacious, it's the perfect blend of style and functionality.",
