    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton Multipass Mini handbag · Designer: Nicolas Ghesquière · Dimensions: 17.5 cm length, 18 cm height, 9.5 cm base · Strap drop: 46–57 cm · Chain drop: 14.5 cm · Weight: 235 g · Retail price ¥16,600",
