      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton is a globally renowned luxury house specializing in luggage and leather goods. Founded by Louis Vuitton in Paris in 1854, it merged with Moët Hennessy in 1987 to form LVMH, the world's largest luxury group. Beyond trunks and handbags, the brand also ventures into fashion, jewelry, eyewear, shoes, watches, and fragrances. Since 1854, from Paris.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
